{"title":"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given a quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> are the midpoints of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b31cd391bebc36897a8c10ea78e5d584980b049.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, respectively.   <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5da1bd2309dd6ebab80a9ada0c1cd7568ff5a30e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"16\" /> intersects at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.  Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e7a6d59564a96612b9fbc7230a8a33d48a3f0f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PO = OR$\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d82f442413dd2dce4c346943a9c4760e0645db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QO = OS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67f01ea0b291325507acbb59e5b4eb346f22c91e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A=(0,0), B=(60,0), C=(40,80), D=(10,50), P=(30,0), Q=(50,40), R=(25,65), SX=(5,25); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(P--Q--R--SX--cycle); draw(A--C, dotted); draw(B--D, dotted); dot(A); label(&quot;A&quot;,A,SW); dot(B); label(&quot;B&quot;,B,SE); dot(C); label(&quot;C&quot;,C,NE); dot(D); label(&quot;D&quot;,D,NW); dot(P); label(&quot;P&quot;,P,S); dot(Q); label(&quot;Q&quot;,Q,E); dot(R); label(&quot;R&quot;,R,N); dot(SX); label(&quot;S&quot;,SX,W); [/asy]\" width=\"198\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Draw lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />.  By SAS Similarity, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34e01fa054d435b3f542c59013b89ebc5af8c963.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DSR \\sim \\triangle DAC,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/e/d2eb8d11c5775068b0d071c9ab487b3a9374106b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CRQ \\sim \\triangle CDB,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"147\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0efde1fd6eb9d86f7c4a6d89ae14a262e02ed0bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ASP \\sim \\triangle ADB,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4ad76f14278f3c0d2baf68a9cff2f34aad730b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CRQ \\sim \\triangle CDB.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"147\" height=\"17\" />  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f34372c55e82cc3070a9751241149ebed95cc52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RQ \\parallel DB \\parallel SP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05b1d223027a823ea65b7d8cd5675eadb775fe3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$SR \\parallel AC \\parallel PQ,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"125\" height=\"19\" /> making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/9/259d1d91a5687fe90489d9efeeab80c4de05cf5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQRS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parallelogram\" title=\"Parallelogram\">parallelogram</a>.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/2/642f3a7d88f9dbe876d30ff27b32b65d33b56656.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair P=(30,0), Q=(50,40), R=(25,65), SX=(5,25); draw(P--Q--R--SX--cycle);  dot(P); label(&quot;P&quot;,P,S); dot(Q); label(&quot;Q&quot;,Q,E); dot(R); label(&quot;R&quot;,R,N); dot(SX); label(&quot;S&quot;,SX,W); draw(Q--SX); draw(P--R); dot((27.5,32.5)); label(&quot;O&quot;,(27.5,32.5),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"188\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/9/259d1d91a5687fe90489d9efeeab80c4de05cf5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQRS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> is a parallelogram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b1449d0f256fbe8b1760e4a84bb59296fbdc62d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS = QP.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" />  In addition, by the Alternating Interior Angle Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1decbf1310e4b0b537558854d6b0ebefbc733047.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle SRP = \\angle RPQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/3715c03cdaac898988554b6dcfddc8d6a65db274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle RSQ = \\angle SQP.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />  Thus, by ASA Congruency, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/5/515bc2fa49c824888606836b9a792edf741e4ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle SRO \\cong \\triangle QPO.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />  Finally, using CPCTC shows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/758a6ab7deb9384bb114a2809563684453455fc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RO = OP$\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0ae344aa53f4ca8285b12f004a9cda108a1b45d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$SO = OQ.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/c/caccc4469f71667311fe9f8f42f6fbbf63fc5cb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = (A_x, A_y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/23406cb9c30a2e6e45086a7fb0bcd4a4b1e5a4d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = (B_x, B_y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44d909d3fa0ad42c12db5a3f3e81edbf136a7eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = (C_x, C_y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c522b3f5530d0319ced7865dc251dae9411ae43a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = (D_x, D_y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />. Then, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/8/e18ca74d9deb3a76a26341eb524fdb72e89f1ebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = (\\dfrac{A_x + B_x}{2}, \\dfrac{A_y + B_y}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"202\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8ad4967ca957516b9d8dcdebe422d1ce7de598c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q = (\\dfrac{B_x + C_x}{2}, \\dfrac{B_y + C_y}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"201\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/4/6f4f6598ca9ed8ca59a559cc92d14eebe850e77a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R = (\\dfrac{C_x + D_x}{2}, \\dfrac{C_y + D_y}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"39\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b8785f967ff50795408b9030eac1937615832e59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = (\\dfrac{D_x + A_x}{2}, \\dfrac{D_y + A_y}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"39\" />. Note that any line that goes through two points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> also goes through their midpoint. So, the line through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> also goes through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5cd4a732ce58e0d9e20275c44591b39e9f8e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\dfrac{A_x + B_x + C_x + D_x}{4}, \\dfrac{A_y + B_y + C_y + D_y}{4})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"342\" height=\"39\" />. Similarly, any line through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> also goes through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5cd4a732ce58e0d9e20275c44591b39e9f8e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\dfrac{A_x + B_x + C_x + D_x}{4}, \\dfrac{A_y + B_y + C_y + D_y}{4})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"342\" height=\"39\" />. That means that both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b23574f89dd13cba5aafb459051f9822407209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{PR}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/1/39125be00860af413a5d58ee395c4b91cdfdb523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{QS}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"21\" /> go through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5cd4a732ce58e0d9e20275c44591b39e9f8e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\dfrac{A_x + B_x + C_x + D_x}{4}, \\dfrac{A_y + B_y + C_y + D_y}{4})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"342\" height=\"39\" />, and because two non-identical lines that intersect only intersect once, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f764186bf20b8b516b6056ac2184b46d82f2432c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O = (\\dfrac{A_x + B_x + C_x + D_x}{4}, \\dfrac{A_y + B_y + C_y + D_y}{4})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"380\" height=\"39\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b23574f89dd13cba5aafb459051f9822407209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{PR}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/1/39125be00860af413a5d58ee395c4b91cdfdb523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{QS}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"21\" />, we have proved that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e7a6d59564a96612b9fbc7230a8a33d48a3f0f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PO = OR$\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d82f442413dd2dce4c346943a9c4760e0645db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QO = OS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> ~Puck_0\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO\">2003 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 332/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11401/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.281      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    8.281      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16627:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202503 and revision id 212170. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}